                                                "sense_id": "3ed34ac6-3765-34a6-a96d-98bfe69bde44",
                                                "text": "Several candidates for the 1996 Republican Presidential nomination and some of the top Republican leaders in Congress are advocating replacing the graduated income tax with a flat tax."
